sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  participant O as Operator
  C->>S: POST …/statements (a long query)<br/>Prefer: respond-async
  S-->>C: 201 running
  O->>S: SIGTERM
  Note over S: draining: running statements<br/>may finish within the grace period
  C->>S: GET /warp/v1/health
  S-->>C: 503 {"status": "not_serving",<br/>"reason": "draining"}
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions<br/>(or a new statement)
  S-->>C: 503 server_draining, Retry-After
  C->>S: GET …/statements/{statement_id}<br/>Prefer: wait=30
  S-->>C: 200 succeeded: the result<br/>can still be read
  Note over S: after the grace period, what remains<br/>is cancelled (server_shutdown)
